  "title": "Zucchini Chocolate Chip Cupcakes",
  "description": "This zucchini chocolate chip cupcake recipe is a wonderful way to use the summer's zucchini harvest. This recipe makes 18 moist, chocolatey cupcakes.",
  "authors": [
